    "market_commentary": "The SSY Pacific Capesize Index slipped 377 points week-on-week to the lowest level in more than a month at 7,417. The W.Australia-China iron ore spot voyage fell by $0.50/t to $10.85/t, while the round-voyage rate dropped by $2,850/day to $27,500/day.",
